#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:5 314fd96af37e45269d593b6aabd7fb2f
msgid "Radio Failsafe"
msgstr "遥控失控保护"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:7 7695fc1ff1f646c397cfa2d5dfba1e95
msgid ""
"RC control is not enabled by default so items in this section would not be "
"applicable. See :ref:`Sub Defaults<sub-defaults>` section to enable."
msgstr "遥控控制默认未启用，因此本节内容可能不适用。请参阅 :ref:`Sub 默认设置<sub-defaults>` 章节以启用。"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:9 4bfbbb7314e044d8affec8cecc6ea360
msgid ""
"Sub supports several configurable failsafe options in cases where contact "
"between the Pilot's RC transmitter and the autopilot's receiver is lost.  "
"This page explains this failsafe's setup and testing.  Note the \"Radio "
"failsafe\" was previously called \"Throttle failsafe\" because of the way in"
" which some receivers use the throttle channel to signal the loss of "
"contact."
msgstr ""
"Sub "
"在飞手遥控发射机与飞控接收机之间失去联系时，支持多种可配置的失控保护选项。本页说明此失控保护的设置和测试方法。注意，「无线电失控保护」以前称为「油门失控保护」，原因是某些接收机使用油门通道来发出失去联系的信号。"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:13 e319ccec21b34d5cb96c1c9c0c1a9fc8
msgid ""
"Sub also supports other failsafes, see the :ref:`failsafe-landing-page`."
msgstr "水下机器人还支持其他失控保护，请参见 :ref:`failsafe-landing-page`。"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:16 8ac7aeeab59246c78860f5f282e5d331
msgid "When the failsafe will trigger"
msgstr "失控保护的触发条件"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:17 3f4dcf64cb874ae288d991ab71b0fe64
msgid ""
"If enabled and set-up correctly the radio failsafe will trigger if any of "
"these conditions occur for more than :ref:`RC_FS_TIMEOUT<RC_FS_TIMEOUT>` "
"seconds:"
msgstr ""
"如果已启用并正确设置，当以下任一条件持续超过 :ref:`RC_FS_TIMEOUT<RC_FS_TIMEOUT>` 秒时，无线电失控保护将触发："

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:19 14aeb8a5025a4683b4ea3c3697f46a74
msgid "The pilot turns off the RC transmitter."
msgstr "飞手关闭遥控发射机。"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:20 463aa6264c6f436597e0652d20498473
msgid "The vehicle travels outside of RC range and signal is lost."
msgstr "飞行器飞出RC信号范围导致信号丢失。"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:21 898c434203d142df8d76dc96b96daf22
msgid ""
"The pilot forces the throttle channel below "
":ref:`FS_THR_VALUE<FS_THR_VALUE>` from the transmitter."
msgstr "飞手在遥控器上将油门通道强制拉低至 :ref:`FS_THR_VALUE<FS_THR_VALUE>` 以下。"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:22 ec386cf6a738469fb1c12f484ddb360a
msgid "The receiver loses power (unlikely)."
msgstr "接收机断电（较为罕见）。"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:23 5108b727c1954e9ea9b562d557367c72
msgid ""
"The wires connecting the receiver to the autopilot are broken (unlikely)."
msgstr "连接接收机与飞控的导线断裂（较为罕见）。"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:27 44490580803042f1b16c7f6f1c2139ce
msgid "What will happen"
msgstr "触发后的行为"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:28 02ec6e7a1ca84792b3a6f5b60ce25371
msgid ""
"When a radio failsafe is triggered, the vehicle can be configured via "
"parameters to do nothing, warn the GCS, or switch mode to SURFACE."
msgstr "当遥控失控保护触发时，可通过参数将飞行器配置为：不执行任何操作、向地面站发出警告或切换至 SURFACE 模式上浮。"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:30 e170ebdcfddb4215a36bfdba0f3e7184
msgid ""
"If the rc failsafe clears (i.e. transmitter and receiver regain contact) the"
" vehicle will remain in its failsafe mode. It will **not** automatically "
"return to the flight mode that was active before the failsafe was triggered."
" If the pilot wished to re-take control he/she would need to change the RC "
"flight mode switch to another position."
msgstr ""
"若遥控失控保护解除（即发射机与接收机恢复联系），飞行器将保持在失控保护模式，**不会** "
"自动切换回失控保护触发前的飞行模式。若飞手希望重新取得控制权，需要将遥控飞行模式开关拨至另一位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:33 88cc858e6a5d4425acb937164b077661
msgid "Receiver Configuration"
msgstr "接收机配置"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:34 8cbe3726e2ea401b851ca2554361a095
msgid ""
"By default, most newly purchased receivers will simply not output pulses if "
"contact with the transmitter is lost. However, some older low end receivers "
"will be set-up to simply hold all channels at their last known position.  "
"This is not good because the autopilot has no way to know that the Pilot has"
" lost control of the vehicle.  Instead the receiver must be set-up to signal"
" to the autopilot it has lost contact and there are two ways that it can do "
"this (the method depends upon the receiver). Each brand of "
"Transmitter/Receiver is slightly different so please refer to your "
"transmitter's user manual to determine which method is available and how to "
"set it up."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，大多数新购接收机在与发射机失去联系时会直接停止输出脉冲。然而，部分较旧的低端接收机会被设置为保持所有通道在最后已知位置。这种方式不理想，因为飞控无法得知飞手已失去对飞行器的控制。接收机必须被配置为向飞控发送失去联系的信号，有两种方式可以实现（具体取决于接收机型号）。每个品牌的发射机/接收机略有不同，请参阅发射机用户手册以确定可用的方式及设置方法。"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:37 6592060b54c148829765a3642d761038
msgid "Receiver configuration for low-throttle method"
msgstr "低油门方式的接收机配置"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:38 a1c42ead9a57440fae6deb1507f007c6
msgid ""
"The **\"Low-Throttle\" method** pulls the throttle channel (normally channel"
" 3) to a value below the bottom of its normal range (normally below 1000us)."
"  This method is used by Futaba systems and many older systems.  Below is "
"the setup method for a Futaba T7C Transmitter with R617FS or TFR4-B receiver"
" which uses the \"low throttle\" method."
msgstr ""
"**「低油门」方式** 将油门通道（通常为第 3 通道）拉低至其正常范围底部以下（通常低于 1000µs）。该方式被 Futaba "
"系统和许多旧系统采用。以下是使用「低油门」方式的 Futaba T7C 发射机配合 R617FS 或 TFR4-B 接收机的设置方法。"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:43 4e5ed4c34e354a23bd336f1902637aeb
msgid ""
"Many receivers allow for the failsafe positions to be set either by simply "
"pressing a button on the receiver, or directly from the transmitter. In this"
" case, the transmitter is temporarily adjusted to output a throttle signal "
"below the normal low idle position (for example,if low idle is 1000us, then "
"990uS would be sent) setting this as the failsafe value for the receiver, "
"then adjusting low stick back to normal idle position. This below throttle "
"idle value is then set for :ref:`FS_THR_VALUE<FS_THR_VALUE>`, as discussed "
"below."
msgstr ""
"许多接收机允许通过按下接收机上的按钮或直接从发射机来设置失控保护位置。在这种情况下，临时将发射机调整为输出低于正常低怠速位置的油门信号（例如，若低怠速为"
" 1000µs，则发送 990µs），并将此值设置为接收机的失控保护值，然后将低摇杆调回正常怠速位置。此低于油门怠速的值随后设置为 "
":ref:`FS_THR_VALUE<FS_THR_VALUE>`，如下所述。"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:46 5f18d9005ddf4726b26fcd90af2078e6
msgid "Receiver configuration for No-Signal method"
msgstr "无信号方式的接收机配置"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:47 021359863ad743c490f646da8b1271a6
msgid ""
"**\"No Signal\" method** - the receiver stops sending signals to the "
"autopilot.  This is the preferred method and is how most modern receivers "
"operate. Below is the setup method for a FlySky 9 channel transmitter with "
"FrSky D4R-II receiver which uses the \"No Signal\" method."
msgstr ""
"**「无信号」方式** — 接收机停止向飞控发送信号。这是首选方式，也是大多数现代接收机的工作方式。以下是使用「无信号」方式的 FlySky 9 "
"通道发射机配合 FrSky D4R-II 接收机的设置方法。"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:53 8d4207ee9b774556ace5914f0a6e98d1
msgid "Parameter Configuration"
msgstr "参数配置"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:54 2afaa3c5f974401cae7dbd6b75e5e7e5
msgid ""
"The :ref:`FS_THR_ENABLE<FS_THR_ENABLE>` parameter can be set in the Mission "
"Planner full parameter list or full parameter tree, or can also be set using"
" the Mission Planner *failsafe options* dropdown in the Initial Setup >> "
"Mandatory Hardware >> Failsafe menu."
msgstr ""
":ref:`FS_THR_ENABLE<FS_THR_ENABLE>` 参数可在 Mission Planner "
"的完整参数列表或完整参数树中设置，也可以通过 Mission Planner 的Initial Setup >> Mandatory Hardware "
">> Failsafe菜单中的*失控保护选项*下拉菜单进行设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:56 e0aedc6e17914a5387ea4bfa41a29fe2
msgid "**Disabled** (Value 0) will disable the radio failsafe entirely."
msgstr "**禁用** （值 0）将完全禁用无线电失控保护。"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:57 26323f016c254db5ad59a2b5baefc1f0
msgid ""
"**Warn only, prevent arming** (Value 1) Send a GCS message and prevent "
"arming if unarmed."
msgstr "**仅警告，禁止解锁** （值 1）发送地面站消息，并在未解锁状态下禁止解锁。"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:58 eace129fd42245698dddf2e4bec6001a
msgid "**Surface** (Value 2) change mode to SURFACE."
msgstr "**上浮** （值 2）切换至 SURFACE 模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:60 687f05604f0346a4993e1fa54f48a96a
msgid ""
"The :ref:`FS_THR_VALUE<FS_THR_VALUE>`  parameter can be set in the Mission "
"Planner full parameter list or full parameter tree, or can also be set using"
" the Mission Planner *FS PWM* value in the Initial Setup >> Mandatory "
"Hardware >> Failsafe menu. It should be set:"
msgstr ""
":ref:`FS_THR_VALUE<FS_THR_VALUE>` 参数可在 Mission Planner 的完整参数列表或完整参数树中设置，也可通过"
" Mission Planner 初始设置 >> 必要硬件 >> 失控保护菜单中的 *FS PWM* 值进行设置。应将其设置为："

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:62 367faa9c5e0d46239221f29c4270b50f
msgid ""
"At least 10 us higher than your Throttle Input Channel (usually 3) PWM value"
" when the throttle stick is fully down and the transmitter is **off**"
msgstr "至少比发射机 **关闭** 时油门杆完全下压的油门输入通道（通常为 3）PWM 值高 10µs"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:63 7b83a4456d8440c29d3238f2a9f1a478
msgid ""
"At least 10 us lower than your Throttle Input Channel (usually 3) PWM value "
"when the throttle stick is fully down and the transmitter is **on**"
msgstr "至少比发射机 **开启** 时油门杆完全下压的油门输入通道（通常为 3）PWM 值低 10µs"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:64 ed3e97db6d0f4f2fa852863e151abe48
msgid "Above 910 PWM"
msgstr "高于 910 PWM"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:67 a15e9c5838c34181979f382d0fe07f2b
msgid "Testing"
msgstr "测试"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:68 c00656ca605f4604b4dd112b2d115c2b
msgid ""
"You can check your failsafe by performing the following tests with the "
"autopilot connected to the Mission Planner either via a USB cable or "
"telemetry link. You can complete these tests without plugging in your LiPo "
"battery but if you do connect a battery you should first be sure if the "
"thrusters run, it will be safe."
msgstr ""
"可通过以下测试验证失控保护，飞控可通过 USB 线缆或数传链路连接至 Mission "
"Planner。可以在不插入锂聚合物电池的情况下完成这些测试，但若连接了电池，应首先确认推进器运转时是安全的。"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:73 a7ec367438a84e6a909e93548be7e09d
msgid ""
"**Test #1** : if using the \"Low-Throttle\" method, ensure the throttle "
"channel drops with loss of radio contact"
msgstr "**测试 #1**：若使用「低油门」方式，确认无线电联系丢失时油门通道下降"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:75 6a62294788cb4f8ba7dcf96dc66d5187
msgid "Ensure your RC transmitter is on and connected with the throttle all"
msgstr "确保遥控发射机已开启并连接，油门全程"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:76 df374bfa88354330b2961923f20a03be
msgid "the way down and flight mode set to MANUAL."
msgstr "拉到最低，飞行模式设置为 MANUAL。"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:79 9f9bd4ff82bf4c418afb336c37d36a41
msgid "The throttle (channel 3) PWM value should be approximately as in"
msgstr "油门（第 3 通道）PWM 值应大约如"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:78 b11900173c404a128176fb30a1c3e215
msgid ""
"first illustration below.  Its value may be higher or lower but it should "
"definitely be at least 10us higher than the value held in the FS PWM field"
msgstr "下方第一张图所示。其值可能偏高或偏低，但必须至少比 FS PWM 字段中保存的值高 10µs"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:83 7d2eab6b8541486fa01cf45e7419adb6
msgid "Turn the transmitter off and the throttle PWM value should drop to be"
msgstr "关闭发射机，油门 PWM 值应下降至"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:82 18281425da21418c919159db3c8e8cb5
msgid ""
"at least 10us below the FS PWM field value (as in the second illustration "
"below) below"
msgstr "低于 FS PWM 字段值至少 10µs（如下方第二张图所示）"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:88 59f0cb19d4b94f22a7e6687e2ef09dab
msgid ""
"A GCS message noting the failure will occur and the mode switch to SURFACE "
"if that action has been selected with :ref:`FS_THR_ENABLE<FS_THR_ENABLE>`."
msgstr ""
"地面站将收到故障通知消息，若已通过 :ref:`FS_THR_ENABLE<FS_THR_ENABLE>` 选择了该动作，模式将切换至 SURFACE。"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:90 cc7d03a59bea4a7d83969b40c14deef6
msgid "If disarmed, a pre-arm message will be sent and arming prevented."
msgstr "若处于解除解锁状态，将发送预解锁消息并禁止解锁。"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:93 9565f012f9434b1c823916b2087491d0
msgid "**Test #2** : retaking control after the failsafe has cleared"
msgstr "**测试 #2**：失控保护解除后重新获取控制权"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:95 514398e4619347c3bfed8b1ccacefbf6
msgid "Continuing on from test #1, turn your transmitter back on"
msgstr "在测试 #1 的基础上，重新开启发射机"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:96 17e78298fb3248e08c8fb77aa5bfcdf5
msgid ""
"While the flight mode is still SURFACE, the pre-arm warnings should "
"disappear(assuming nothing else is preventing arming) and a notice that RC "
"has been reaquired sent to the GCS."
msgstr "在飞行模式仍为 SURFACE 时，预解锁警告应消失（假设无其他阻止解锁的因素），并向地面站发送遥控已重新获取的通知。"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:97 47cf866dd44e4fa8bf2d4b3aec9b6f18
msgid ""
"You should be able to arm the vechicle now and change modes via the RC "
"flight mode control channel."
msgstr "现在应能解锁飞行器并通过遥控飞行模式控制通道切换模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:99 f98bad1ef3fc43f2ab364d20de2313fa
msgid "**Test #3** (optional) : removing power from the receiver"
msgstr "**测试 #3** （可选）：断开接收机电源"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:101 488f48ec474142b0bff83a0257962142
msgid ""
"Switch to STABLIZE mode, arm your motors and keep your throttle above zero."
msgstr "切换至 STABILIZE 模式，解锁推进器并保持油门高于零。"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:103 7a4ef7da893342008ac387d33aed7011
msgid ""
"Carefully disconnect the power wires connecting the receiver to the "
"autopilot"
msgstr "小心断开连接接收机与飞控的电源线"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:105 5c8585ff259c472686ee9738ebb56980
msgid "The autopilot should failsafe as described in Test #1"
msgstr "飞控应如测试 #1 所述触发失控保护"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:107 24bd2dcc3ee14260863c7cd5698648d9
msgid ""
"Unplug the autopilot so that it is powered down before reattaching the "
"receiver's power to assure the receiver is detected during autopilot "
"initialization."
msgstr "拔掉飞控电源使其断电，然后再重新连接接收机电源，以确保在飞控初始化时能检测到接收机。"
